  "thig1.2:1.1": "Mutte muccassu yogehi ",
  "thig1.2:1.2": "cando Rāhuggaho iva | ",
  "thig1.2:1.3": "vippamuttena cittena ",
  "thig1.2:1.4": "anaṇā bhuñjāhi piṇḍakaṃ. ",
  "thig1.2:2.1": "itthaṃ sudaṃ bhagavā Muttaṃ sikkhamānaṃ imāya gāthāya abhiṇhaṃ ovadati. || "
}
